---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2 id="about-heading" class="section-heading">
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="prompt">~/</span><span data-i18n="about.section">about</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="section-command" aria-hidden="true"><span data-i18n="about.command">$ cat about.md</span></p>

    <div class="about-content">
      <p data-i18n="about.p1">
        I'm a software developer with a passion for building clean, performant, and thoughtful software. I love working across the stack and care deeply about code quality and developer experience.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="about.p2">
        When I'm not writing code, I enjoy exploring new technologies, contributing to open source, and sharing what I learn with the community.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="about.p3">
        I believe great software is built at the intersection of technical rigour and human empathy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-content p { margin: 0; }
</style>
